{"type":"message","id":"142b3bba","parentId":"b3d5b6b7","timestamp":"2026-03-26T11:04:56.458Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All three cron jobs are timing out. The issues are:\n1. **OpenClaw 反馈检查** (every 30m): times out\n2. **每日晚间 workspace 收口** (21:05): times out\n3. **每日 8 点晨报** (08:00): times out\n\nThe cron run timeout seems to be the issue. This means the cron jobs are taking longer than the allowed execution time.\n\nLooking at the schedule:\n- The \"OpenClaw 反馈检查\" every 30m is the most critical one - it's supposed to check GitHub for new feedback and needs to be fixed\n\nThe issue is likely that the GitHub API calls are taking too long or the agent is getting stuck. \n\nIt could also be hitting gateway rate limits. The morning briefing and workspace cleanup are less critical since they've already run successfully before, but the 30-minute feedback check is the priority issue that needs resolving.\n\nThe cron execution itself is timing out, which suggests either the GitHub commands are hanging or the gateway's cron timeout is set too short. I should run the feedback check manually right now to see what's actually happening, and then recommend bumping up the timeout value for the affected cron jobs.","thinkingSignature":"71329cff4188198e629e6f9ebe9a6a8db8187ef85133a998fccffd73528440a6"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n**⚠️ Cron 任务状态异常 — 3 个 error，均因执行超时**\n\n| 任务 | 上次运行 | 问题 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| OpenClaw 反馈检查 (every 30m) | 12 分钟前 | ⏱️ 超时 |\n| 每日 8 点晨报 | 6 小时前 | ⏱️ 超时 |\n| 每日晚间 workspace 收口 | 22 小时前 | ⏱️ 超时 |\n\n---\n\n**原因**：cron 执行 timeout，任务没在规定时间内完成。\n\n**可能的根因**：\n1. GitHub API 调用挂住（网络或 rate limit）\n2. agent 执行逻辑内有耗时操作卡住\n\n---\n\n**🔧 需要修复**：\n\n1. **立即**：我来手动跑一遍 OpenClaw 反馈检查，看卡在哪一步\n2. **需要确认**：cron 任务的 timeout 默认是多少？能否调大？\n\n先手动跑一下看看实际耗时：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_h5s2yuab0k52_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"time openclaw cron run b1694774-49f0-42b0-aa7d-37e5