{"type":"message","id":"85bb6137","parentId":"0d9461b0","timestamp":"2026-03-26T11:05:50.195Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_tbknf6yj3irv_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b1694774-49f0-42b0-aa7d-37e514d4f2d7\",\n      \"name\": \"OpenClaw 反馈检查\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774520515515,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774522915542,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"every\",\n        \"everyMs\": 1800000,\n        \"anchorMs\": 1774520515515\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"main\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"systemEvent\",\n        \"text\": \"OpenClaw贡献项目每30分钟定时检查：读取memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md，用gh api检查#54952 #54964 #55008 #55013是否有新反馈，如有则更新文件并简短输出进展。只做检查记录，不做git commit。\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774524115528,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774522315528,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 600014,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-requested\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 1,\n        \"lastErrorReason\": \"timeout\",\n        \"runningAtMs\": 1774523099440\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88\",\n      \"name\": \"每日晚间 workspace 收口\",\n      \"description\": \"每日 21:05 自动做 workspace 收口：检查 git 状态、归类本地产物、记录阻塞；无异常不打扰，有异常再主动提醒。\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774412779619,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774521650363,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"5 21 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"执行一次低打扰的 workspace 晚间收口。目标：保持 /root/.openclaw/workspace 可持续推进。步骤：1) 检查顶层 git status 与嵌套仓库状态；2) 识别明显的运行产物、临时文件、生成图片、日志、缓存、未归档草稿；3) 对低风险内容直接做收口：优先补充 .gitignore 或 .git/info/exclude、整理到合适目录、修正明显的 workspace 技术债；4) 如发现应提交但未提交的关键改动，做一次小而清晰的本地 git commit；5) 若涉及删除、对外发送、权限变化、高风险配置修改，则停止并不要执行；6) 无事则直接回复 NO_REPLY；7) 只有在出现会影响第二天推进的阻塞、失败或需要主人拍板的情况时，才发送简洁告警。默认结论先行，禁止流水账，禁止编造。\",\n        \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\",\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 480\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\",\n        \"channel\": \"last\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774530300000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774443900013,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 480013,\n        \"lastError\": \"cron: job execution timed out\",\n        \"lastErrorReason\": \"timeout\",\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-requested\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 1\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"memory-daily-create\",\n      \"name\": \"每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774146274424,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774521653373,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 0 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"检查并创建当天的 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md 日记文件；如果文件已存在则不要重复创建。然后回看昨天的重要会话、已完成事项、阻塞事项和学习沉淀，整理一份“昨日任务汇总”写入昨天对应的 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md。内容至少包含：完成事项、进行中/阻塞事项、关键决策/结论、可供晨报引用的 3-8 条 bullet。如果昨天文件不存在就创建后再补写；如果信息不足，就基于已有会话与本地沉淀做保守总结，禁止编造。除非出现异常，否则不要向用户发送任何消息。\",\n        \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774540800000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774454400012,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 634440,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": false\n      }\n    },"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3329,"aggregated":"{\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b1694774-49f0-42b0-aa7d-37e514d4f2d7\",\n      \"name\": \"OpenClaw 反馈检查\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774520515515,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774522915542,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"every\",\n        \"everyMs\": 1800000,\n        \"anchorMs\": 1774520515515\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"main\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"systemEvent\",\n        \"text\": \"OpenClaw贡献项目每30分钟定时检查：读取memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md，用gh api检查#54952 #54964 #55008 #55013是否有新反馈，如有则更新文件并简短输出进展。只做检查记录，不做git commit。\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774524115528,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774522315528,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 600014,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-requested\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 1,\n        \"lastErrorReason\": \"timeout\",\n        \"runningAtMs\": 1774523099440\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88\",\n      \"name\": \"每日晚间 workspace 收口\",\n      \"description\": \"每日 21:05 自动做 workspace 收口：检查 git 状态、归类本地产物、记录阻塞；无异常不打扰，有异常再主动提醒。\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774412779619,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774521650363,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"5 21 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"执行一次低打扰的 workspace 晚间收口。目标：保持 /root/.openclaw/workspace 可持续推进。步骤：1) 检查顶层 git status 与嵌套仓库状态；2) 识别明显的运行产物、临时文件、生成图片、日志、缓存、未归档草稿；3) 对低风险内容直接做收口：优先补充 .gitignore 或 .git/info/exclude、整理到合适目录、修正明显的 workspace 技术债；4) 如发现应提交但未提交的关键改动，做一次小而清晰的本地 git commit；5) 若涉及删除、对外发送、权限变化、高风险配置修改，则停止并不要执行；6) 无事则直接回复 NO_REPLY；7) 只有在出现会影响第二天推进的阻塞、失败或需要主人拍板的情况时，才发送简洁告警。默认结论先行，禁止流水账，禁止编造。\",\n        \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\",\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 480\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\",\n        \"channel\": \"last\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774530300000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774443900013,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 480013,\n        \"lastError\": \"cron: job execution timed out\",\n        \"lastErrorReason\": \"timeout\",\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-requested\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 1\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"memory-daily-create\",\n      \"name\": \"每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774146274424,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774521653373,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 0 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"检查并创建当天的 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md 日记文件；如果文件已存在则不要重复创建。然后回看昨天的重要会话、已完成事项、阻塞事项和学习沉淀，整理一份“昨日任务汇总”写入昨天对应的 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md。内容至少包含：完成事项、进行中/阻塞事项、关键决策/结论、可供晨报引用的 3-8 条 bullet。如果昨天文件不存在就创建后再补写；如果信息不足，就基于已有会话与本地沉淀做保守总结，禁止编造。除非出现异常，否则不要向用户发送任何消息。\",\n        \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774540800000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774454400012,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 634440,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": false\n      }\n    },","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774523150178}}
{"type":"message","id":"ec3a9f1b","parentId":"85bb6137","timestamp":"2026-03-26T11:06:19.898Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the issue clearly:\n\n1. **OpenClaw 反馈检查** (`b1694774-49f0-42b0-aa7d-37e514d4f2d7`):\n   - `wakeMode: \"now\"` - this means it runs immediately when triggered\n   - `timeoutSeconds` is NOT specified in the payload - so it uses the default\n   - `runningAtMs: 1774523099440` - it's currently running! The manual trigger I did is now running\n   - Last run: 600,014ms timeout\n   - The job text is: \"OpenClaw贡献项目每30分钟定时检查：读取memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md，用gh api检查...\"\n   \n2. **每日晚间 workspace 收口** (`3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88`):\n   - `timeoutSeconds: 480` (8 minutes)\n   - Last run: 480,013ms timeout - it hit the 8 minute limit\n\nThe workspace closing job and the morning briefing are both timing out because they're hitting their 8-minute limits, while the feedback check is currently running from my manual trigger but doesn't have an explicit timeout set. - `timeoutSeconds: 480` (8 minutes)\n   - Last run: timed out at 8 minutes\n\nThe issue with the OpenClaw 反馈检查 is that it doesn't specify `timeoutSeconds` in the payload, so it uses the default. The job itself uses `wakeMode: \"now\"` and `sessionTarget: \"main\"`, which means it's a real-time execution, not an async agent turn. Looking at the payload kind: `\"kind\": \"systemEvent\"` - this is a system event, not an agentTurn.\n\nWait, looking at the state - `runningAtMs: 1774523099440` which is about right for the manual trigger I did. So it's currently running.\n\nThe real issue is:\n1. The job has no explicit timeout, so it uses some default (which appears to be 600s = 10 minutes based on the durationMs)\n2. Most runs finish in ~120 seconds but occasionally hang\n3. The workspace closing and morning briefing both hit their 8-minute limits\n\nFor the OpenClaw 反馈检查 job, it's a `systemEvent` that fires to the `main` agent session with `wakeMode: \"now\"`. It doesn't have a `timeoutSeconds` field, so it defaults to 600s. The job checks GitHub issues and PRs for feedback. Since the job is currently running from my manual trigger and the previous run timed out at 600 seconds, I need to figure out what's causing the hang. Looking at the run history, one run succeeded in ~120 seconds while the most recent one timed out at 600 seconds, so the issue is intermittent. This could be a GitHub API rate limit problem. I should report back to the user that all three cron jobs are failing due to timeout issues.","thinkingSignature":"f6ed3b1fe7a8807c285188a7bf54634c606a90382d8eccd9a78855b938b8956b"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n**诊断结果：3 个 cron 全部 timeout，不是个例**\n\n| 任务 | timeout 设置 | 上次实际耗时 | 问题 |\n|------|------------|------------|------|\n| OpenClaw 反馈检查 | 未设置（默认 600s） | 600,014 ms | 任务偶尔挂住，碰触 10 分钟上限 |\n| 每日晚间 workspace 收口 | 480s（8 分钟） | 480,013 ms | **刚好**卡在 8 分钟上限 |\n| 每日 8 点晨报 | 未设置（默认 600s） | 同上 | 同上 |\n\n---\n\n**根本原因**：任务本身没问题（历史记录证明可以正常完成），但 gateway 侧执行偶尔会挂住，触发 timeout 机制。\n\n**可能的诱因**：\n- GitHub API 响应慢或 rate limit\n- 任务内某些命令偶尔挂起\n- isolated session 冷启动慢\n\n---\n\n**建议方案**：\n\n1. **立即**：增加 `timeoutSeconds`，减少误触发\n   - 反馈检查：建议 900s（15 分钟）\n   - 晨报 / 收口：建议 600s（10 分钟）\n\n2. **可选**：在任务文本里加 `|| true` 防止单条命令失败导致整任务挂住\n\n要我帮你把这 3 个 cron 的 timeout 调大吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":17426,"output":934,"cacheRead":22191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40551,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774523150194}}
