{"type":"message","id":"1699950f","parentId":"fdfbf89b","timestamp":"2026-03-26T11:16:21.678Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hmm, the edit didn't seem to apply the timeout. Let me check the current cron list to see if the timeout was actually set.","thinkingSignature":"b07a33eb5ee0b47a75d5f76de2d9280ca408aef55a5973213dca129347c145c5"},{"type":"text","text":"\n没生效，检查一下 edit 语法：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2sxajutz9neo_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron edit --help 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":17287,"output":70,"cacheRead":22191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39548,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774523778941}}
{"type":"message","id":"cdd19508","parentId":"1699950f","timestamp":"2026-03-26T11:16:24.568Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_2sxajutz9neo_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.11 (29dc654) — Claws out, commit in—let's ship something mildly responsible.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron edit [options] <id>\n\nEdit a cron job (patch fields)\n\nArguments:\n  id                                   Job id\n\nOptions:\n  --account <id>                       Channel account id for delivery\n                                       (multi-account setups)\n  --agent <id>                         Set agent id\n  --announce                           Announce summary to a chat\n                                       (subagent-style)\n  --at <when>                          Set one-shot time (ISO) or duration like\n                                       20m\n  --best-effort-deliver                Do not fail job if delivery fails\n  --channel <channel>                  Delivery channel (last)\n  --clear-agent                        Unset agent and use default (default:\n                                       false)\n  --clear-session-key                  Unset session key (default: false)\n  --cron <expr>                        Set cron expression\n  --delete-after-run                   Delete one-shot job after it succeeds\n                                       (default: false)\n  --deliver                            Deprecated (use --announce). Announces a\n                                       summary to a chat.\n  --description <text>                 Set description\n  --disable                            Disable job (default: false)\n  --enable                             Enable job (default: false)\n  --every <duration>                   Set interval duration like 10m\n  --exact                              Disable cron staggering (set stagger to\n                                       0)\n  --expect-final                       Wait for final response (agent) (default:\n                                       false)\n  --failure-alert                      Enable failure alerts for this job\n  --failure-alert-account-id <id>      Account ID for failure alert channel\n                                       (multi-account setups)\n  --failure-alert-after <n>            Alert after N consecutive job errors\n  --failure-alert-channel <channel>    Failure alert channel (last)\n  --failure-alert-cooldown <duration>  Minimum time between alerts (e.g. 1h,\n                                       30m)\n  --failure-alert-mode <mode>          Failure alert delivery mode (announce or\n                                       webhook)\n  --failure-alert-to <dest>            Failure alert destination\n  -h, --help                           Display help for command\n  --keep-after-run                     Keep one-shot job after it succeeds\n                                       (default: false)\n  --light-context                      Enable lightweight bootstrap context for\n                                       agent jobs\n  --message <text>                     Set agentTurn payload message\n  --model <model>                      Model override for agent jobs\n  --name <name>                        Set name\n  --no-best-effort-deliver             Fail job when delivery fails\n  --no-deliver                         Disable announce delivery\n  --no-failure-alert                   Disable failure alerts for this job\n  --no-light-context                   Disable lightweight bootstrap context for\n                                       agent jobs\n  --session <target>                   Session target (main|isolated)\n  --session-key <key>                  Set session key for job routing\n  --stagger <duration>                 Cron stagger window (e.g. 30s, 5m)\n  --system-event <text>                Set systemEvent payload\n  --thinking <level>                   Thinking level for agent jobs\n  --timeout <ms>                       Timeout in ms (default: \"30000\")\n  --timeout-seconds <n>                Timeout seconds for agent jobs\n  --to <dest>                          Delivery destination (E.164, Telegram\n                                       chatId, or Discord channel/user)\n  --token <token>                      Gateway token (if required)\n  --tz <iana>                          Timezone for cron expressions (IANA)\n  --url <url>                          Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to\n                                       gateway.remote.url when configured)\n  --wake <mode>                        Wake mode (now|next-heartbeat)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2880,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.11 (29dc654) — Claws out, commit in—let's ship something mildly responsible.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron edit [options] <id>\n\nEdit a cron job (patch fields)\n\nArguments:\n  id                                   Job id\n\nOptions:\n  --account <id>                       Channel account id for delivery\n                                       (multi-account setups)\n  --agent <id>                         Set agent id\n  --announce                           Announce summary to a chat\n                                       (subagent-style)\n  --at <when>                          Set one-shot time (ISO) or duration like\n                                       20m\n  --best-effort-deliver                Do not fail job if delivery fails\n  --channel <channel>                  Delivery channel (last)\n  --clear-agent                        Unset agent and use default (default:\n                                       false)\n  --clear-session-key                  Unset session key (default: false)\n  --cron <expr>                        Set cron expression\n  --delete-after-run                   Delete one-shot job after it succeeds\n                                       (default: false)\n  --deliver                            Deprecated (use --announce). Announces a\n                                       summary to a chat.\n  --description <text>                 Set description\n  --disable                            Disable job (default: false)\n  --enable                             Enable job (default: false)\n  --every <duration>                   Set interval duration like 10m\n  --exact                              Disable cron staggering (set stagger to\n                                       0)\n  --expect-final                       Wait for final response (agent) (default:\n                                       false)\n  --failure-alert                      Enable failure alerts for this job\n  --failure-alert-account-id <id>      Account ID for failure alert channel\n                                       (multi-account setups)\n  --failure-alert-after <n>            Alert after N consecutive job errors\n  --failure-alert-channel <channel>    Failure alert channel (last)\n  --failure-alert-cooldown <duration>  Minimum time between alerts (e.g. 1h,\n                                       30m)\n  --failure-alert-mode <mode>          Failure alert delivery mode (announce or\n                                       webhook)\n  --failure-alert-to <dest>            Failure alert destination\n  -h, --help                           Display help for command\n  --keep-after-run                     Keep one-shot job after it succeeds\n                                       (default: false)\n  --light-context                      Enable lightweight bootstrap context for\n                                       agent jobs\n  --message <text>                     Set agentTurn payload message\n  --model <model>                      Model override for agent jobs\n  --name <name>                        Set name\n  --no-best-effort-deliver             Fail job when delivery fails\n  --no-deliver                         Disable announce delivery\n  --no-failure-alert                   Disable failure alerts for this job\n  --no-light-context                   Disable lightweight bootstrap context for\n                                       agent jobs\n  --session <target>                   Session target (main|isolated)\n  --session-key <key>                  Set session key for job routing\n  --stagger <duration>                 Cron stagger window (e.g. 30s, 5m)\n  --system-event <text>                Set systemEvent payload\n  --thinking <level>                   Thinking level for agent jobs\n  --timeout <ms>                       Timeout in ms (default: \"30000\")\n  --timeout-seconds <n>                Timeout seconds for agent jobs\n  --to <dest>                          Delivery destination (E.164, Telegram\n                                       chatId, or Discord channel/user)\n  --token <token>                      Gateway token (if required)\n  --tz <iana>                          Timezone for cron expressions (IANA)\n  --url <url>                          Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to\n                                       gateway.remote.url when configured)\n  --wake <mode>                        Wake mode (now|next-heartbeat)","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774523784559}}
{"type":"message","id":"4b845f8a","parentId":"cdd19508","timestamp":"2026-03-26T11:16:36.298Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - it's `--timeout-seconds` for agent jobs, not `--timeout`. The `--timeout` is in ms. Let me fix the crons:\n\n1. `b1694774-49f0-42b0-aa7d-37e514d4f2d7` - OpenClaw 反馈检查 - needs `--timeout-seconds`\n2. `3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88` - 每日晚间 workspace 收口 - already has 480s timeoutSeconds, needs to increase\n3. `morning-briefing` - 每日 8 点晨报 - needs `--timeout-seconds`\n\n\nNow I'm updating each one with the appropriate timeout values.","thinkingSignature":"6f6cb9fd4e6025bc8d911d6deb5168956fe76038ddf6098a6d4593f773cb6ff3"},{"type":"text","text":"是 `--timeout-seconds`，马上修：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_oa5t9zm4cmnm_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 1. 反馈检查：从默认 → 900s\nopenclaw cron edit b1694774-49f0-42b0-aa7d-37e514d4f2d7 --timeout-seconds 900 2>&1 | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('✅ 反馈检查 timeout:', d.get('payload',{}).get('timeoutSeconds','?'))\"\necho \"\"\n# 2. 晚间收口：从480s → 900s  \nopenclaw cron edit 3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88 --timeout-seconds 900 2>&1 | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('✅ 晚间收口 timeout:', d.get('payload',{}).get('timeoutSeconds','?'))\"\necho \"\"  \n# 3. 晨报：默认 → 900s\nopenclaw cron edit morning-briefing --timeout-seconds 900 2>&1 | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('✅ 晨报 timeout:', d.get('payload',{}).get('timeoutSeconds','?'))\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":18173,"output":467,"cacheRead":22191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40831,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774523784567}}
