{"type":"message","id":"cd548d1e","parentId":"5c824d37","timestamp":"2026-03-26T11:17:52.544Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the morning-briefing is an `agentTurn` with `timeoutSeconds: 900`. The feedback check is a `systemEvent`, which doesn't accept `--timeout-seconds`. The issue is that for `systemEvent` payloads, there's no way to set a timeout via the CLI.\n\nThe simplest solution would be to delete and recreate the feedback check cron as an `agentTurn` instead of `systemEvent`. That way we can set `--timeout-seconds`.\n\nAlternatively, I could try to use the `--timeout` flag but it's not working.\n\nLet me try deleting and recreating the feedback check cron with the correct settings.","thinkingSignature":"88c28addb4ed603cc3c7a811f1b2802f92f3e0c5e59dcb2dda4f901573a0e806"},{"type":"text","text":"反馈检查是 `systemEvent` 类型，timeout 设置不生效。需要重建为 `agentTurn` 类型：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1vwdfog7vdt1_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron rm b1694774-49f0-42b0-aa7d-37e514d4f2d7 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":22708,"output":209,"cacheRead":22191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45108,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774523863542}}
