{"type":"message","id":"8e924ea9","parentId":"cdea2a66","timestamp":"2026-03-26T11:18:23.635Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still systemEvent. The `--system-event` flag creates a systemEvent payload. To create an agentTurn, I need to use `--message` instead. But the cron run logic is different for agentTurn vs systemEvent. Let me think...\n\nActually, the real issue is that the feedback check cron is a systemEvent that sends a text message to the main agent session. The main agent then processes it. The timeout is applied at the agent session level, not the cron level.\n\nWait, but the other agentTurn crons work fine with timeoutSeconds. The issue might be that systemEvent crons don't support custom timeouts at all.\n\nLooking at the problem more carefully - the error was \"cron: job execution timed out\" which suggests the cron itself is timing out, not the agent. \n\nSo for systemEvent crons, the gateway likely applies a default timeout that I can't override through the CLI. The gateway might enforce a hard timeout regardless of what I set. But the error message is \"cron: job execution timed out\" not \"cron: job timeout\" - both crons failed with similar durations, but the morning briefing has a different error format. Maybe the distinction is that the gateway's timeout behavior differs between systemEvent and agentTurn, or perhaps the timeout setting itself isn't being applied correctly to systemEvent payloads.\n\nI should try converting the feedback check cron to use `--message` with `--agentTurn` instead of `--system-event`, and make sure the timeout is properly configured at the gateway level. Let me test whether setting an explicit timeout actually takes effect, and if not, recreate it with `--every 30m` to ensure the duration is correct.","thinkingSignature":"e1ee8b90e4211cbc9bf75d54d4fe18631d8bf22a558fd516a0cdc237ee34fe5d"},{"type":"text","text":"`--system-event` 仍然创建 systemEvent，需要重建为 agentTurn 才能用 `--timeout-seconds`。先删再创：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l6apmunkt30b_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw cron rm 94ec559c-33cd-4764-b885-318b5f9bb9b6 2>&1\necho \"已删除，现在重建为 agentTurn\"\nopenclaw cron add \\\n  --name \"OpenClaw 反馈检查\" \\\n  --every 30m \\\n  --session main \\\n  --timeout-seconds 900 \\\n  --message \"OpenClaw贡献项目每30分钟定时检查：读取memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md，用gh api检查#54952 #54964 #55008 #55013是否有新反馈，如有则更新文件并简短输出进展。只做检查记录，不做git commit。\" \\\n  2>&1 | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('✅ ID:', d.get('id'), '| kind:', d.get('payload',{}).get('kind'), '| timeout:', d.get('payload',{}).get('timeoutSeconds'))\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":23369,"output":594,"cacheRead":22191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46154,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774523890116}}
