{"type":"message","id":"f723be9d","parentId":"42e84a44","timestamp":"2026-03-26T11:19:14.649Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The cron was added. But the issue is that the gateway still has a hard timeout for systemEvent crons on the main session. The `timeout` command in the message text is a hint to the agent, but the gateway will still cut the execution after 600s.\n\nActually, I realize the core problem: the cron task is running as a \"systemEvent\" on the main session. The main session is the persistent Feishu group chat session. When a systemEvent comes in, it's delivered to the main session and the main agent processes it. But the cron gateway seems to have a hard timeout.\n\nActually wait - maybe the issue is that the `main` session itself has a timeout. The cron delivers a systemEvent to the main session, but if the main session is busy (like right now in this conversation), the event might queue up and then get processed late, causing the cron to think it timed out.\n \nI should try switching the cron to use the `isolated` session instead, since the docs mention that isolated sessions run separately and won't conflict with the main session's availability window. Let me verify what session types are actually supported.","thinkingSignature":"6dc1b98ea1226fa0cf6c1f1b517cd9d0f11ae0b2cd0f09b6929488ac6a834c66"},{"type":"text","text":"等等 — 根本问题是 systemEvent 任务打到 busy 的 main session 上会排队，导致超时。应该用 isolated session 跑这个任务：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zdeypskjh69y_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 先删掉刚创建的那个\nopenclaw cron list --json 2>&1 | python3 -c \"\nimport json,sys\ndata=json.load(sys.stdin)\nfor j in data['jobs']:\n    if '反馈检查' in j['name']:\n        print(j['id'])\n\" | xargs -I{} openclaw cron rm {} 2>&1\necho \"---已删除旧 cron---\"\n# 用 isolated session 重建\nopenclaw cron add \\\n  --name \"OpenClaw 反馈检查\" \\\n  --every 30m \\\n  --session isolated \\\n  --timeout-seconds 900 \\\n  --message \"OpenClaw贡献项目每30分钟定时检查。步骤：1) 读取 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md；2) 用 gh api 检查 #54952 #54964 #55008 #55013 是否有新反馈（每次 gh api 加 timeout 15秒防卡死：timeout 15 gh api ...）；3) 如有反馈则更新 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 并输出简短进展；4) 如无反馈直接回复 NO_REPLY；5) 全程禁止 git commit。\" \\\n  2>&1 | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('✅ 新建成功 | ID:', d.get('id'), '| kind:', d.get('payload',{}).get('kind'), '| timeout:', d.get('payload',{}).get('timeoutSeconds'), '| session:', d.get('sessionTarget'))\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":25181,"output":617,"cacheRead":22191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47989,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774523941806}}
