ld send a reminder\n\nBut it's also evening time, and the user said they don't stay up late (21:00). This is a short evening reminder that should be concise.\n\n主人，傍晚工作提醒（19:49）：\n\n**📊 OpenClaw 贡献项目状态**\n- P1 #54952：已发布，等待 maintainer 反馈\n- P1b #54964：已发布，等待 maintainer 反馈\n- P3 #55008：ling 已修复 skills 误删问题，等待 maintainer 反馈\n- P4 #55013：ling 已修复 groupPolicy 描述问题，等待 maintainer 反馈\n\n**📅 今日工作即将结束**\n现在是 19:49，距离下班还有约1小时。邮箱和提及已超过12小时未检查，如有重要事务建议查看。\n\n**✅ 今日完成**\n- P1/P1b issue 已发布\n- P3/P4 PR 已修复并等待 review\n- ling 已处理 Greptile review 反馈\n\n需要我协助推进其他事项吗？"},{"type":"text","text":"检查结果：\n1. 日历：没有未来2小时内的日程\n2. 邮箱：上次检查约12小时前\n3. 提及：上次检查约12小时前\n4. 上次主动汇报：约11.5小时前（8:20）\n\n根据 HEARTBEAT.md 的\"主动提醒条件\"：距离上次主动汇报已超过8小时，且确实有新信息 → 需要主动提醒。\n\n现在是 7:49 PM，接近下班时间。提供简短傍晚提醒：\n\n主人，傍晚进度提醒（19:49）：\n\n**📊 OpenClaw 贡献项目状态**\n- P1 #54952 / P1b #54964：已发布，等待 maintainer 反馈（0 comments）\n- P3 #55008：ling 已修复 skills 误删问题，等待 review\n- P4 #55013：ling 已修复 groupPolicy 描述问题，等待 review\n\n**📅 今日工作收尾**\n- 邮箱/提及已超过12小时未检查\n- 今日工作即将结束（21:00 下班）\n\n**✅ 今日主要完成**\n- P1/P1b issue 正式发布\n- P2/P3 PR 已修复 Greptile review 指出的问题\n- ling 已完成 PR 修复并提交\n\n如需查看详细项目状态，可随时告知。明日可继续等待 maintainer 反馈。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774526420155}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:57a448ff-1805-4a54-a6cd-3fcdbb5fb8f3","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","updatedAt":1774527979924,"sessionId":"805b6f50-ed08-4f50-9113-e32305696baa","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":25150,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/805b6f50-ed08-4f50-9113-e32305696baa.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the feedback:\n\n1. **Issue #54952**: No comments (0 comments) - same as before\n2. **Issue #54964**: No comments (0 comments) - same as before\n3. **PR #55008**: Greptile feedback about skills entry removed - BUT this was already addressed according to the log (ling already pushed a fix commit `bac6026fd3`)\n4. **PR #55013**: Multiple Greptile feedback about groupPolicy - BUT this was also already addressed according to the log (ling already pushed a fix commit `feeea5f817`)\n\n\n5. **Codex review on #55013**: Just an informational note with no actual review comments\n\nLooking at the logs, both issues were supposedly resolved with commits, but the GitHub comments are still showing the old feedback unresolved. Either the commits weren't pushed to GitHub yet, or they didn't actually address the underlying problems the reviewers raised.\n\nSince the status log indicates these were already handled and the greptile comments remain stale, there's nothing new requiring action - the fixes are already in progress."},{"type":"text","text":"NO_REPLY"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774528000545}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:5bc9519b-f4e2-4719-ba7b-67f8773049bd","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","updatedAt":1774525764524,"sessionId":"5bc2633c-115f-4164-a947-30b0badeb275","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":28201,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/5bc2633c-115f-4164-a947-30b0badeb275.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me reply with the summary as required."},{"type":"text","text":"**进展汇报（19:49 定时检查）**\n\n**PR #55008 / #55013**：Greptile 自动化 review 发现了两个问题——skills 注册误删（#55008）和 groupPolicy 描述错误（#55013）。ling 已推送修复 commit，两个 PR 现均为 2 commits，review 评论已 stale，待 maintainer 重新审查或 merge。\n\n**Issue #54952 / #54964**：仍 0 条 maintainer 评论，无新进展。\n\n整体状态无变化，继续等 maintainer 反馈。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774525834701}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5ab