Context":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774520275387,"sessionId":"cef80983-8de9-495b-9aae-54f7ab3b18f1","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":95413,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/ling/sessions/cef80983-8de9-495b-9aae-54f7ab3b18f1.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send timed out again. Let me just reply in the current session as instructed."},{"type":"text","text":" 两个 PR 修复均已完成并提交：\n\n**PR #55008**（`docs/clarify-message-channel-plugin-extensibility`）\n- 恢复 `extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json` 中的 `\"skills\": [\"./skills\"]` 行\n- Commit: `bac6026fd3`\n\n**PR #55013**（`docs/clarify-feishu-routing-fallback`）\n- 修正 4 个文档中 groupPolicy 的错误描述：明确它是**访问控制机制**（open/allowlist/disabled），不是\"选择哪个 agent 处理\"的机制\n- 修改文件：`docs/channels/feishu.md`、`docs/zh-CN/channels/feishu.md`、`docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md`、`docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-reference.md`\n- Commit: `feeea5f817`\n\n回 main 会话超时，请确认是否收到。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774520269462}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:5b4ed491-b2e5-4575-afc9-9e67a88777c5","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 反馈检查","updatedAt":1774520250211,"sessionId":"9bfd55f9-c84a-4474-8b32-2c15886bca30","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":28627,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/9bfd55f9-c84a-4474-8b32-2c15886bca30.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done. The results have been written to the file. Let me summarize what was done."},{"type":"text","text":"结果已追加写入 `/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/openclaw-feedback-check.txt`。\n\n**摘要：**\n- **#54952** — 无新动态\n- **#54964** — 无新动态\n- **#55008** — 有1条 Greptile review 反馈：意外移除了 feishu 插件的 skills 注册条目，需 revert\n- **#55013** — 有3条 review 反馈（Greptile x2 + ChatGPT-Codex x1）：一致指出 groupPolicy 是访问控制参数而非 agent 选择参数，文档描述有误"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774520391721}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:59434d74-31e7-45c5-98bc-db917fcc79dd","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目状态检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目状态检查","updatedAt":1774520086242,"sessionId":"8c772f4a-e8ec-4cdb-90b7-559d799e9548","model":"deepseek-v3.2","systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/8c772f4a-e8ec-4cdb-90b7-559d799e9548.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看起来 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件不存在。让我先检查 memory 目录是否存在，然后创建项目状态文件。\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_z60yuxxrv1bnqqyvdacjnott","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la memory/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774520285707}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:f957cfab-2639-496f-ae42-abdf9ecdc18f","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目每 30 分钟推进检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目每 30 分钟推进检查","updatedAt":1774519359936,"sessionId":"74365216-ffde-4a40-9575-6a2f31029a78","model":"deepseek-v3.2","systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/74365216-ffde-4a40-9575-6a2f31029a78.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在运行 i18n 脚本：\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ojcyfllnxor0otlh8vi9qglz","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd"},"partialJson":"{\"command\": \"cd"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1774514730213,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted."}]},{"key":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-aoao-feishu-aoao-direct-ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774511062649,"sessionId":"7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":83014,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/aoao/sessions/7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a critical finding. The PR #55008 has a serious regression - it accidentally removes `\"skills\": [\"./skills\"]` from the feishu plugin manifest, which would silently break all feishu skills (feishu-doc, feishu-drive, feishu-perm, feishu-wiki). This is a P1 issue.\n\nAlso, the zh-CN file is a generated file and shouldn't be manually edited.\n\nSo for the 3 submissions review, let me give quick one-line anchor answers:\n\n1. P1 issue #54952 (diagnostics gap): Already reviewed, is relatively stable.\n\n\n2. P1b issue #54964 (session zombie state): Already reviewed, framing is weaker.\n3. P3 PR #55008: This has a P1 regression - skills entry removed from feishu plugin while skills directory still exists. The zh-CN file is also a generated file that shouldn't be manually edited.\n\nLet me give the main a very brief alert on PR #55008 since this is a significant issue that needs immediate attention."},{"type":"text","text":"**PR #55008 有 P1 回归风险——需要立即确认。**\n\nGreptile review 已发现：PR 移除了 `extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json` 里的 `\"skills\": [\"./skills\"]`，但 `./skills` 目录仍存在且包含 4 个活跃 skill（feishu-doc/drive/perm/wiki）。这会悄悄注销所有飞书 skill。另外 zh-CN 文件是生成文件，手动编辑会导致 `source_hash` 过期。\n\n---\n\n三句话预判：\n\n**#54952（diagnostics gap）：**\n- 最可能追问：\"What specific diagnostic surface do you want — a log field, a CLI command, or a doc clarification?\"\n- 压舱：Open to any form — the core ask is making the winning routing rule inspectable from the operator side.\n\n**#54964（session zombie）：**\n- 最可能追问：\"Is this a product bug or a misconfiguration triggering an expected init failure?\"\n- 压舱：Even if triggered by bad config, silent `replies=0` with no recovery is poor UX that warrants a fix.\n\n**#55008（docs/message）：**\n- 最可能追问（已有 Greptile 标 P1）：\"Did you intentionally remove the skills entry from the feishu plugin? That de-registers four active skills.\"\n- 压舱：If unintentional, both the plugin manifest and the generated metadata need revert before this can merge."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774511044404}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","displayName":"feishu:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","updatedAt":1774506631356,"sessionId":"a68614d5-9196-482f-b1b3-e88896055820","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/a68614d5-9196-482f-b1b3-e88896055820.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**OpenClaw 问题记录：Session 异常状态未自动恢复**\n\n---\n\n**问题描述**\n当 embedded agent 初始化失败时（如 `deactivated_workspace` 错误），对应的 session 会进入\"半死\"状态：\n- 后续消息正常 dispatch\n- Gateway 记录 `dispatch complete (queuedFinal=false, replies=0)`\n- Agent 实际不回复，用户看到完全无响应\n- 手动从 sessions.json 删除缓存才能恢复\n\n**触发条件**\n1. 群聊 session 中 embedded agent 启动时遇到 `deactivated_workspace` 错误\n2. Session 被标记为\"已初始化\"但实际未正常运作\n3. 后续所有消息都在这个坏 session 里排队，但永远零回复\n\n**影响范围**\n- 群聊 session 路由（`group` 类型）\n- 触发后该 session 完全阻塞，直到手动清理 sessions.json\n\n**Workaround**\n手动删除 `/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/sessions.json` 中对应 key，重建 session\n\n**根因分析**\n- `deactivated_workspace` 错误没有触发 session 清理机制\n- Session 状态机在 agent 初始化失败时未进入正确的错误处理路径\n- Gateway dispatch 层认为\"已送达\"，但 agent 层实际未运行\n\n**建议处理方向**\n- 在 agent 初始化失败时，session 应自动标记为 `abortedLastRun=true` 或触发自动清理\n- 提供 graceful recovery 机制，而不是静默死掉\n- 考虑增加 session 健康检查或超时回收\n\n---\n\n*来源：2026-03-26 群聊故障排查，由 main agent 记录*"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774506631381}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:morning-briefing","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报","displayName":"Cron: 每日早报 + InStreet 学习汇报","updatedAt":1774502507113,"sessionId":"f551725a-dc4e-4a15-bd07-00f04a98cdc5","model":"deepseek-v3.2","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":29624,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/f551725a-dc4e-4a15-bd07-00f04a98cdc5.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我需要指定发送目标。从AGENTS.md中我看到我的sessionKey，但我需要发送给主人。让我查看是否有直接发送给用户的方式。根据指令，我需要直接将晨报发送给主人。让我使用消息工具指定目标：\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_nqlq0hwzdq7i418g9bpsqeg2","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"主人","message":"**晨报 2026-03-26 (周四，13:21)**\n\n**总览摘要**\n1. 昨日完成workspace深度整理与自动化工作流升级，新增两项低打扰定时任务\n2. OpenClaw贡献项目方向已收敛为diagnostics/observability gap定位，issue草稿就绪\n3. 晨报主链路已完全迁移至OpenClaw内建cron，补强失败告警机制\n\n**昨日重点任务**\n[已完成] workspace完成深度整理，顶层git状态收敛干净，可持续推进\n[已完成] 晨报主链路统一到OpenClaw内建cron，增加失败立即告警至飞书\n[已完成] 新增两项自动化任务：10:30贡献推进检查、21:05 workspace晚间收口\n[推进中] OpenClaw贡献项目P1已收敛为diagnostics/observability gap方向，英文issue草稿可直接使用\n[推进中] P2 docs PR范围已缩到最小澄清补丁，等待P1先发后跟进\n[决策] 已明确\"session key ≠ routing rule解释器\"，后续文档与issue按此口径表述\n[待观察] 新建cron的实际运行效果，需"},"partialJson":"{\"action\": \"send\", \"target\": \"主人\", \"message\": \"**晨报 2026-03-26 (周四，13:21)**\\n\\n**总览摘要**\\n1. 昨日完成workspace深度整理与自动化工作流升级，新增两项低打扰定时任务\\n2. OpenClaw贡献项目方向已收敛为diagnostics/observability gap定位，issue草稿就绪\\n3. 晨报主链路已完全迁移至OpenClaw内建cron，补强失败告警机制\\n\\n**昨日重点任务**\\n[已完成] workspace完成深度整理，顶层git状态收敛干净，可持续推进\\n[已完成] 晨报主链路统一到OpenClaw内建cron，增加失败立即告警至飞书\\n[已完成] 新增两项自动化任务：10:30贡献推进检查、21:05 workspace晚间收口\\n[推进中] OpenClaw贡献项目P1已收敛为diagnostics/observability gap方向，英文issue草稿可直接使用\\n[推进中] P2 docs PR范围已缩到最小澄清补丁，等待P1先发后跟进\\n[决策] 已明确\\\"session key ≠ routing rule解释器\\\"，后续文档与issue按此口径表述\\n[待观察] 新建cron的实际运行效果，需"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1774503084212,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted."}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:de883cd9-8125-48f5-b87b-9ea99b0548a9","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目每日推进检查","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 贡献项目每日推进检查","updatedAt":1774492200361,"sessionId":"4a55bcc3-17f3-4dd1-a777-3c76345b10ae","model":"deepseek-v3.2","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":30149,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/4a55bcc3-17f3-4dd1-a777-3c76345b10ae.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看起来xixi和aoao的会话都在，但可能处于非活跃状态。让我检查工作区中是否有可以直接推进的明确动作。基于我读取的信息，现在总结检查结果：\n\n根据我的检查，当前状态如下：\n\n**[待拍板]**\n1. P1 diagnostics gap issue草稿已准备就绪，但需要最终确认是否已补齐所有证据字段并可直接发布\n2. P2 docs PR最小补丁大纲已定，但需要决定是否等待P1 issue反馈后再提交\n\n**[进展]**\n1. 项目方向已稳定收敛：从\"疑似bug\"转为\"diagnostics/observability gap\"框架，提高issue成功率\n2. 已产出可直接贴GitHub的英文issue草稿v2，包含完整背景、问题描述、建议改进和最小复现\n3. 多Agent分工明确：main协调、xixi调研产出、aoao风险审查，协作链路已建立\n\n**[阻塞]**\n1. 当前无明确阻塞，但需要确认xixi和aoao的实时状态以获取最新进展\n2. 需要决定是否立即发布P1 issue，还是等待进一步证据补充\n\n**建议行动：**\n1. 立即检查并发布P1 diagnostics gap issue到GitHub\n2. 准备P2 docs PR作为跟进\n3. 继续按既定策略推进，无需等待\n\n根据任务要求，只有出现明确可发草稿、高价值发现或阻塞时才发简报。目前已有可直接发布的issue草稿，符合发简报条件。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774492544327}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:instreet-idle-learning","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习","displayName":"Cron: InStreet/Skills 每日 5 点学习","updatedAt":1774472400018,"sessionId":"a5344040-6fbb-4e20-8f12-05b602971d5c","model":"deepseek-v3.2","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":34378,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/a5344040-6fbb-4e20-8f12-05b602971d5c.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"学习任务已完成。我已经访问并学习了InStreet的公开技能文档，包括主skill.md、groups-skill.md、literary-skill.md、arena-skill.md和oracle-skill.md等。根据学习内容，我提炼了以下关键发现：\n\n## 主要学习成果：\n\n1. **平台架构**：InStreet分为论坛和Playground两大区域，使用严格的API分离策略\n2. **注册机制**：采用混淆数学挑战题防机器人，5分钟有效期，5次尝试机会\n3. **心跳流程**：每30分钟执行，将\"回复自己帖子上的新评论\"放在最高优先级\n4. **Instance理念**：将Agent视为\"在线生命切片\"，强调留下清晰推理链和可复用经验\n5. **核心规则**：包括parent_id回复、独立API使用、429限频处理等规范化设计\n\n## 可借鉴经验：\n- 验证挑战设计平衡安全与用户体验\n- 用户互动优先的策略\n- 模块化API设计保持功能边界清晰\n- 结构化错误处理和重试机制\n\n## 明确舍弃点：\n- 哲学化叙事和强persona导向\n- 生搬硬套心跳流程到工作场景\n- 过度游戏化倾向\n\n学习笔记已按固定格式追加到`/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/instreet-learning.md`文件中，包含发现、可吸收经验、明确舍弃点和可用于晨报的5条bullet。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774472497913}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:memory-daily-create","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务","displayName":"Cron: 每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务","updatedAt":1774454400017,"sessionId":"b84fa1e5-6c5b-4a9a-bd1f-63bca943dec8","model":"gpt-5.4","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":50712,"systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/b84fa1e5-6c5b-4a9a-bd1f-63bca943dec8.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c053fc43defc6370169c408fa1f788191b0a17013a11f4072\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774455033084}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日晚间 workspace 收口","displayName":"Cron: 每日晚间 workspace 收口","updatedAt":1774443900304,"sessionId":"d4fb27ec-5485-489e-8e36-cc1d268fcd7a","model":"deepseek-v3.2","systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/d4fb27ec-5485-489e-8e36-cc1d268fcd7a.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1774444180591,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted."}]},{"key":"agent:weiwei:feishu:weiwei:group:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","kind":"group","channel":"webchat",