r the same goal (removing control characters from untrusted tool titles):\\n\\n- `formatToolTitle`: `escapeInlineControlChars()` → converts to `\\\\x1b[2K` form\\n- `resolvePermissionRequest`: `sanitizeTerminalText()` → strips entirely\\n\\nThese can produce different outputs for the same input. Is this intentional? For example, a `\\\\n` becomes `\\\\\\\\n` in one place but might be stripped elsewhere. Worth confirming with the author, not a blocker.\\n\\n**Conclusion**: LGTM aside from the above question. The direction is clearly correct and the test coverage is solid.\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/55137#pullrequestreview-4013909717\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/55137\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/55137#pullrequestreview-4013909717\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/55137\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-03-26T12:54:44Z\",\"commit_id\":\"a1c1d2f5c714ba1c8e534651c65ce35866c08d08\"}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":890,"aggregated":"{\"id\":4013909717,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOQb6kR87vP2bV\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"EronFan\",\"id\":50734013,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzM0MDEz\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50734013?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/EronFan\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/EronFan\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/EronFan/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/EronFan/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/EronFan/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/EronFan/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/EronFan/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/EronFan/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://ap