{"type":"message","id":"25a459d2","parentId":"8df401c0","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:39:43.383Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The feedback check file is old - last updated at 18:19 (before the fixes). But that's ok because the cron now updates OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md directly and returns NO_REPLY.\n\nNow, for the user's question about tomorrow:\n\nThe key memory mechanisms are:\n1. **MEMORY.md** - updated by me continuously with project decisions\n2. **OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md** - updated throughout today with current status\n3. **memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md** - daily diary created by cron at midnight\n\nThe risk is:\n- Tomorrow morning when I start fresh, I need to know what we're working on\n- The cron `memory-daily-create` runs at midnight and creates a diary from yesterday's conversation history\n\n\n- But if the cron fails or creates a summary without specific OpenClaw details, I could lose project context\n\nThe evening workspace wrap-up cron at 21:05 is supposed to consolidate the day's work, but it keeps timing out. I need to ensure that OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md gets properly wrapped up tonight so tomorrow I can just read it and have all the context I need to continue.\n\nI could write a dedicated script that runs tonight to pull the current project state and inject a summary into tomorrow's memory file, ensuring the OpenClaw project status survives even if the cron fails. The cron itself is isolated and scheduled for around 22 hours from now, so that's not the immediate concern—it's the workspace consolidation happening right now that matters.","thinkingSignature":"992923c08b66d115e4190a5317f3676955de337f3900fe7bfb645d3f4f2f1d6e"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好问题，说一下现状和我的判断：\n\n**已有的机制：**\n- `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md` — 实时更新，今天的所有决策都在里面（项目事实来源）\n- `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` — 每日 cron 凌晨 0 点创建，记录当天发生了什么\n- `MEMORY.md` — 长期记忆，今日更新了 OpenClaw 贡献目标\n\n**潜在风险：**\n- 晚间 workspace 收口 cron（21:05）最近连续 timeout，没跑成功\n- 明天我重启时，理论上会读 `memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md`，但如果 cron 没做收口，我需要自己读一遍才知道进度\n\n**我现在的动作：**\n\n现在立刻更新 `OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md`，在文件开头写清楚「这是什么项目、当前所有 open 项的完整状态」，确保明天我只要读这一篇就能无缝接上：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_odee12jt4uoy_1","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":20,"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":72700,"output":549,"cacheRead":22191,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95440,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774535966654}}
